Type	Purpose	SemVer impact
feat	a new feature	MINOR
fix	a bug fix	PATCH
docs	documentation only changes (README, comments)	none
style	formatting, whitespace, semicolons (no change in behavior)	none
refactor	code restructuring without changing behavior and without fixing a bug	none
perf	a performance improvement	usually PATCH
test	adding or fixing tests	none
build	build system or dependencies (npm, Maven, Dockerfile)	none
ci	CI/CD configuration (GitHub Actions, Jenkinsfile)	none
chore	maintenance tasks that don’t fit elsewhere (e.g. updating .gitignore)	none
revert	reverting a previous commit	depends

Examples

feat: add login endpoint
fix(validation): fix email check
docs: update README with run instructions
chore: add node_modules to .gitignore
ci: add GitHub Actions workflow with tests
test(auth): add test for wrong password
refactor: extract argument parsing function
